25Maintenance contract                                                    000482
26   Maintenance contract for all maintenance-relevant plant              000483
26   parts of this bill of quantities for the duration of                 000484
26   the warranty period.                                                 000485
26                                                                        000486
26   With conclusion of the maintenance contract the period               000487
26   of the warranty is extended to 4 years.                              000488
26                                                                        000489
26   The maintenance contract contains the following                      000490
26   services to be carried out annually:                                 000491
26   1. Inspecting the plant.                                             000492
26   2. Maintaining the plant.                                            000493
26   3. Supplying and replacing the wearing parts of the                  000494
26   plant required for faultless function and operational                000495
26   safety, whose service life under usual operating                     000496
26   conditions falls short of the warranty period; incl.                 000497
26   proper disposal of the old parts and materials.                      000498
26   4. Supplying or providing all aids needed (e.g.                      000499
26   measuring instruments, tools) and auxiliary materials                000500
26   (e.g. lubricants and cleaning agents), including                     000501
26   ladders and vehicles.                                                000502
26                                                                        000503
26   In good time before acceptance a detailed maintenance                000504
26   contract in PERSON_097 is to be submitted to the AG.                 000505
26                                                                        000506
26   The EP offered covers the period between acceptance and              000507
26   end of the warranty period, i.e. four years.                         000508
26   Billing outside the final invoice, in each case after                000509
26   expiry of one year.                                                  000510
26                                                                        000511
26   The maintenance contract is commissioned separately                  000512
26   after acceptance according to the unit price offered                 000513
26   here.                                                                000514
