26                                                                        000952
26   Cross-flow aeration system or [PERSON_00000066] for                  000953
26   physical deacidification of drinking water in                        000954
26   energetically optimised design.                                      000955
26   By fine-bubble air injection via ceramic elements of                 000956
26   glass-bonded sintered material the carbonic acid is                  000957
26   stripped out; Simple aerator cassette change by means                000958
26   of side pull-out and lateral opening elements.                       000959
26   Depending on item text in one or two-storey design;                  000960
26   Entire apparatus ([PERSON_00000066]) executed gas-tight              000961
26   in pressure stage 3/6 according to DIN 24190                         000962
26   (+6500/-500 Pa); Tightness class IV according to DIN EN              000963
26   1507 with highest requirement, limit value of the air                000964
26   leakage rate class acc. to D DIN E1507 < 0,006 cmü/min;              000965
26   The gas tightness is to be proven to the client on                   000966
26   request;                                                             000967
26   Complete apparatus described below fabricated as sheet               000968
26   metal construction, in predominantly folded and bolted               000969
26   execution, welding stresses are to be minimised,                     000970
26   therefore all casing stiffeners are to be connected                  000971
26   force-fit to the sheet metal construction without                    000972
26   welding; Minimum material thickness for the entire                   000973
26   construction 3 mm; All steel parts in stainless PER89                000974
26   with the material no. 1.4571, fabricated in                          000975
26   ferrite-free rooms and after processing pickled and                  000976
26   passivated in a full bath; Packed in film at the                     000977
26   factory and assembled with film;                                     000978
26   All bolted connections (e.g. cover bolting) that cannot              000979
26   be executed as through bolting are to be produced with               000980
26   easily exchangeable thread inserts i.e. threaded holes               000981
26   in sheet metal parts are not permitted; The aeration                 000982
26   system is built up Modular; The modules connected in                 000983
26   series (train) are connected horizontally by means of                000984
26   rectangular flange; In order to guarantee a permanent                000985
26   tightness between the modules, a sealing system is used              000986
26   that is able to decouple the weight forces to be                     000987
26   transmitted from the sealing forces needed, i.e. a                   000988
26   force-fit connection is produced between the metals;                 000989
26   This sealing system (hereinafter called connection                   000990
26   adapter with sealing device) is clamped in each case                 000991
26   between the modules to be connected and consists of one              000992
26   solid rectangular flange each with corresponding                     000993
26   connection threads as well as O-ring seals worked in                 000994
26   all round with a hardness of 40 Shore; The aeration                  000995
26   elements must meet the requirements of the KTW and pass              000996
26   the tests for microbiological growth (DVGW worksheet                 000997
26   W270); Casing and cover seals by means of profile seal               000998
26   with KTW and DVGW W270 approval with a minimum Shore                 000999
26   hardness of 40ø, according to DIN53505 and DIN7868 (use              001000
26   of sealing compounds excluded); A detail design drawing              001001
26   of the complete [PERSON_00000066]s is to be included in              001002
26   the prices and submitted to site management in good                  001003
26   time before ordering for checking and approval; Because              001004
26   of the high energy efficiency required, all components               001005
26   are to be executed in highly flow-favourable optimised               001006
26   form; The compliance with all required max. pressure                 001007
26   losses as well as listed dimensions are to be complied               001008
26   with without fail and proven to site management on                   001009
26   request in good time before delivery; The supplier must              001010
