26   [PERSON_00000070] ### BBE-2.1                                        001577
26   Material PER000115 drawing no. 58.00.00.00-R3,                       001578
26   for free-flowing bulk materials, in particular also for              001579
26   use in low rooms,                                                    001580
26   consisting of a robust steel frame, incl. lifting                    001581
26   device. The lifting device is mounted on rollers and                 001582
26   equipped with an adjustable chains cone that shapes the              001583
26   Big Bag conically.                                                   001584
26   Triggering of the lifting device by gas springs on                   001585
26   weight decrease in the Big Bag. Suitable for almost all              001586
26   Big Bag sizes.                                                       001587
26   For Big Bags dimension: up to approx. 120 cm x 100 cm                001588
26   (B x L),                                                             001589
26   Total height: approx. 1190 mm                                        001590
26   Gas spring stroke: approx. 350 mm                                    001591
26   Frame material: PER000115 1.4301                                     001592
26   Surface: glass bead blasted                                          001593
26                                                                        001594
26   Including maintenance-free rope-iris dosing valve, ###               001595
26   BIDV-7.1-S-S, long version, with manual operation and                001596
26   re-locking.                                                          001597
26   (The re-locking automatically turns the valve further                001598
26   closed by means of integrated gas springs when material              001599
26   settles in the Big Bag outlet).                                      001600
26   The valve rotary unit consists of a roller-guided                    001601
26   slewing ring with glass-fibre-stabilised stainless                   001602
26   steel rope arcs, plastic-reinforced, which are arranged              001603
26   in iris shape. The hand lever turns by 180ø and is                   001604
26   recessed in the frame section in the end positions.                  001605
26   Valve base housing: material 1.4301                                  001606
26   Valve mechanism: material 1.4301 except bearings                     001607
26   Valve rotary unit: material 1.4301                                   001608
26   The mechanism of the valve is maintenance-free.                      001609
26   Functions directly at the Big Bag outlet: closing                    001610
26   product grain size smaller than 5 æm, dosing, re-tying               001611
26   (partially emptied Big Bags can thereby be taken out                 001612
26   again).                                                              001613
26                                                                        001614
26   Including 1 piece sub-platform for Big Bag PERSON_70,                001615
26   executed as robust stainless steel frame, foot design                001616
