26                                                                        001667
26   Liquid jet ventilator DN 150,                                        001668
26   with the following connections:                                      001669
26   Suction side P060: DN 80,  PN 16 (lateral)                           001670
26   Motive water side: DN 100, PN 16 (axial)                             001671
