26   When placing support and filter layers, the                          001824
26   manufacturer's instructions for filling, installation                001825
26   flushing and disinfection are to be observed:                        001826
26   Partial filling of the filter basin with PER029 to                   001827
26   avoid damage to the filter nozzles                                   001828
26   Place, level and flush quartz gravel acc. to DIN 12904               001829
26   as [PERSON_005] according to the manufacturer's                      001830
26   specifications                                                       001831
26   Hydraulic placing of the GEH© by means of injector                   001832
26   system and motive water                                              001833
26   Installation flushing in upflow to remove the fines                  001834
26   from the adsorber bed, backwash velocity 26 m/h;                     001835
26   flushing until the outflow water is free of turbidity                001836
26   (approx. 15 minutes)                                                 001837
26                                                                        001838
26   Delivery is in Big Bags. Installation is carried out                 001839
26   using the feeding system of motive pump and Big Bag                  001840
26   emptying system likewise included in the scope of this               001841
26   bill of quantities.                                                  001842
26                                                                        001843
